1
00:00:00,636 --> 00:00:02,936
(Penny:)It's getting
kind of cheesy, Leonard.

2
00:00:02,939 --> 00:00:04,039
(Sheldon:)Huh?

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:06,840
(Leonard:)If you think that's
cheesy, buckle up.

4
00:00:08,878 --> 00:00:10,748
(Leonard:)Penny Hofstadter,

5
00:00:10,746 --> 00:00:13,016
(Leonard:)will you please
stay married to me?

6
00:00:14,117 --> 00:00:16,017
(Penny:)Oh, damn it, you topped it.

7
00:00:19,422 --> 00:00:21,852
(Penny:)Should we go to the bedroom
and make this marriage official?

8
00:00:21,858 --> 00:00:23,728
Yes, please!
Okay!

9
00:00:28,987 --> 00:00:31,767
(Penny:)Sheldon, I can't believe
you got us a wedding gift.

10
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:33,640
(Penny:)I don't know
why you're so surprised.

11
00:00:33,638 --> 00:00:36,978
I watch movies;
I see what people do.

12
00:00:36,975 --> 00:00:38,775
(Leonard:)What is this?

13
00:00:38,777 --> 00:00:40,777
(Sheldon:)Plane tickets
and hotel reservations

14
00:00:40,779 --> 00:00:42,809
(Sheldon:)for a weekend away
in San Francisco.

15
00:00:42,814 --> 00:00:44,114
Oh!
Wow!

16
00:00:44,115 --> 00:00:45,785
That's so great!

17
00:00:45,784 --> 00:00:48,884
(Sheldon:)Yeah, there's Fisherman's Wharf
and Alcatraz and cable cars.

18
00:00:48,887 --> 00:00:50,417
(Sheldon:)We're gonna have so much fun.

19
00:00:50,422 --> 00:00:51,592
(knocking on door)

20
00:00:54,625 --> 00:00:56,095
(Penny:)We?

21
00:00:56,094 --> 00:00:57,164
(Sheldon:)Is there a problem?

22
00:00:57,162 --> 00:00:59,692
Oh, no, no!
I just, I said, "Whee!"

23
00:01:01,131 --> 00:01:04,931
(Amy(at door):)How dare you go on the Internet
and say mean things about me

24
00:01:04,936 --> 00:01:08,506
(Amy(at door):)and compare my genitalia
to part of Czechoslovakia?!

25
00:01:09,506 --> 00:01:11,806
(Sheldon:)You saw through that one,
did you?

26
00:01:11,810 --> 00:01:13,380
(Penny:)I don't know
what you were thinking,

27
00:01:13,378 --> 00:01:16,508
but take the video down now!

28
00:01:18,282 --> 00:01:19,512
(Sheldon:)She watched it.

29
00:01:19,517 --> 00:01:21,187
(Sheldon:)I'm gonna get that girl back.

30
00:01:21,186 --> 00:01:24,556
AMY: I only watched it
because you e-mailed it to me

31
00:01:24,556 --> 00:01:26,726
with the subject line:
"This is gonna make you mad"!

32
00:01:29,620 --> 00:01:31,540
(Sheldon:)She was listening through
the door. She wants me.

